{"id":"624884","name":"鲜虾荠菜拌春笋","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/624884/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"春笋","amount":"适量"},{"name":"鲜虾","amount":"2个"},{"name":"荠菜","amount":"几棵"}],"sub":[{"name":"菌油","amount":"1匙"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"春笋，运输时间过久，有点老。","img":"images/624884/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"去壳去老根洗净。","img":"images/624884/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切块，老得部分切厚片。","img":"images/624884/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"冷水下锅焯水。","img":"images/624884/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"嫩尖部分切块。","img":"images/624884/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"老的部分开锅10分钟放嫩尖。","img":"images/624884/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"开锅十分钟。","img":"images/624884/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"捞出冷水浸泡。","img":"images/624884/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"嫩尖分开放。","img":"images/624884/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"把院子的荠菜采了。","img":"images/624884/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"大小不等。","img":"images/624884/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"采了一把。","img":"images/624884/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"洗净。","img":"images/624884/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"焯水。","img":"images/624884/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"取竹笋嫩尖。","img":"images/624884/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"切薄片。","img":"images/624884/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"焯水过得荠菜切末。","img":"images/624884/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"食材放一起。","img":"images/624884/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"取鲜虾，去外壳。","img":"images/624884/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"放锅里煮熟。","img":"images/624884/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"沿后背一分为二，放蔬菜里。","img":"images/624884/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"取菌油。","img":"images/624884/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/624884/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/624884/step_24.jpg"},{"step":25,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/624884/step_25.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}